[116.439516, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[116.462063, "o", "An allow-list rule: list what is allowed; anything not on the list is flagged (default deny).\r\n\r\n  allowed email domains (config.json)   tsg.example\r\n\r\n"]
[116.46225, "o", "  e09  send_email to collector@attacker.example     domain attacker.example   NOT on the list: FLAG\r\n  e14  send_email to aisha.k@tsg.example            domain tsg.example        on the list: allow\r\n\r\nNo list of bad addresses needed: anything new is outside the list. Someone has to keep the list up to date.\r\n"]
