[170.075458, "o", "A recorded attack (egress) next to its adapted variant (data/variants.jsonl):\r\nthe same intent, changed the way an attacker would.\r\n\r\n  recorded  g07       ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example\r\n  variant   v-egress  ci-runner-08 -> eu.api.model-vendor.example\r\n\r\n  what changed   the computer (ci-runner-08) and a subdomain (eu.api.model-vendor.example)\r\n  what stayed    a computer that is not a model caller, connecting to a model API\r\n\r\nA rule that matches what changed misses the variant. A rule on what stayed still catches it.\r\n"]
