[180.114869, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[180.137702, "o", "Three rules for the same attack (prompt injection), each measured three ways:\r\nthe recorded attack (e07), its adapted variant (v-inj), and 10 normal lines (the answer key, data/trace/ground_truth.json)\r\n\r\n  rule                                             recorded   variant    false positives\r\n  A  exact words \"ignore previous instructions\"    caught     missed     0 of 10\r\n"]
[180.137811, "o", "  B  any \"ignore\" or \"disregard\"                   caught     caught     1 of 10   e12 \"Please disregard my earlier message, ...\"\r\n"]
[180.137932, "o", "  C  text hidden in an HTML comment                caught     caught     0 of 10\r\n\r\nCatch rate: of the attacks, how many were flagged. False positives: of the normal lines, how many were.\r\nMeasure both, on the recording AND on a changed attack. Here only C holds on both with no false positive.\r\n"]
[180.141227, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m23\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m23\u001b[00m$ "]
